      "writtenOn": "2026-10-09T20:50:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`staleTime: 60000` does *not* refresh readings. refetchOnMount, refetchOnWindowFocus, and refetchOnReconnect are all false, and there is no refetchInterval. After 60 seconds the query is stale and nothing refetches it. The previous useAllSubResources path used staleTime: Infinity with the same refetch flags. \n\nDropping `gcTime: 300000` is also a no-op: TanStack Query v5’s default gcTime is already 5 minutes.",
      "revId": "2f60e78cc4532abe549e0168ecbdffeaa1a9304d",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
